        "Por qué Artefact": "Why Artefact",
        "La credibilidad viene de unir estrategia, ingeniería y conocimiento industrial.": "Credibility comes from uniting strategy, engineering and industry knowledge.",
        "Artefact compite como pure player global de Data & AI: combina profundidad técnica, entrega end-to-end, certificaciones cloud, aceleradores y equipos multidisciplinarios para industrializar casos de uso en el entorno del cliente.": "Artefact competes as a global Data & AI pure player: it combines technical depth, end-to-end delivery, cloud certifications, accelerators and multidisciplinary teams to industrialize use cases in the client's environment.",
        "Pure player Data & IA": "Pure player Data & AI",
