        "Casos de uso · Air Cargo": "Use Cases · Air Cargo",
        "Inteligencia algorítmica para toda la cadena de valor de carga aérea": "Algorithmic intelligence across the entire air cargo value chain",
        "De la cotización spot a la aduana: dónde la IA agéntica ya genera rentabilidad y cumplimiento en bodegas de pasaje y flotas cargueras.": "From spot quoting to customs clearance: where agentic AI already drives profitability and compliance across passenger holds and freighter fleets.",
        "Cadena de valor adaptativa": "Adaptive value chain",
        "4 frentes estratégicos de la carga aérea": "4 strategic fronts of air cargo",
        "Comercial, operaciones, experiencia B2B y cumplimiento regulatorio, evaluados con el mismo criterio de madurez de datos y viabilidad de despliegue que el resto del portafolio.": "Commercial, operations, B2B experience and regulatory compliance, assessed with the same data-maturity and deployment-viability criteria as the rest of the portfolio.",
        "Comercial & Dynamic Revenue Management": "Commercial & Dynamic Revenue Management",
        "Pricing dinámico spot, sobreventa estocástica bivariada (peso/volumen), micro-negociación autónoma e integración con marketplaces (cargo.one, Freightos).": "Dynamic spot pricing, bivariate stochastic overbooking (weight/volume), autonomous micro-negotiation and integration with marketplaces (cargo.one, Freightos).",
